{% set introText %}<p class="p1">Welcome to Waldgeflüster Events – your exclusive <b>forest wedding and event venue</b> for unforgettable weddings and special celebrations. Surrounded by majestic trees and an idyllic woodland atmosphere, our venue offers the perfect setting to celebrate your most beautiful day – whether with a romantic open-air wedding ceremony or a joyful celebration under the open sky. We shape every moment so it stays with you forever.</p>
