{% set winterTitle %}Winter events and Christmas parties at Waldgeflüster<span class="wg-sub">Company celebrations and Bavarian curling</span>{% endset %}
{% call sectionQuote({ id: 'winter', title: winterTitle }) %}
<p class="p1" style="max-width: 70ch; margin-inline: auto; text-align: center;">In winter, Waldgeflüster transforms into a magical backdrop for special occasions. Our venue offers the perfect setting for Christmas parties, winter festivities, and corporate events – enjoy the first snow, cozy fire pits, and warm mulled-wine receptions in the heart of the forest.</p>
<p class="p1" style="max-width: 70ch; margin-inline: auto; text-align: center;">Experience the warmth of our <b>fire pit</b>, the pleasure of a welcoming <b>mulled-wine reception</b>, and the fun of a round of <b>Bavarian curling</b> together. Every moment is accompanied by the quiet beauty of the winter forest, turning your celebration into an unforgettable experience.</p>
