{% set anfahrtTitle %}How to find us{% endset %}
{% call sectionQuote({ id: 'anfahrt', title: anfahrtTitle }) %}
<p style="max-width: 70ch; margin-inline: auto; text-align: center;">Our Waldgeflüster venue is nestled in a quiet forest landscape yet easy to reach. Here’s an overview of your approximate driving times from the nearest cities:</p>
<div class="wg-counters">
  <div><span>Stuttgart</span><strong data-count-to="50">0</strong><span>Minutes</span></div>
  <div><span>Ulm</span><strong data-count-to="45">0</strong><span>Minutes</span></div>
  <div><span>Tübingen</span><strong data-count-to="40">0</strong><span>Minutes</span></div>
  <div><span>Reutlingen</span><strong data-count-to="24">0</strong><span>Minutes</span></div>
  <div><span>Metzingen</span><strong data-count-to="22">0</strong><span>Minutes</span></div>
  <div><span>Nürtingen</span><strong data-count-to="20">0</strong><span>Minutes</span></div>
</div>
<p style="max-width: 70ch; margin-inline: auto; text-align: center;">With plenty of parking available, arriving by car is easy and convenient. Alternatively, a shuttle service can be arranged so your guests reach the venue relaxed and carefree.</p>
<p style="text-align: center;"><a href="https://www.google.com/maps/place/Waldgeflüster+Eventlocation/@48.5258543,9.4107414,17z/data=!3m1!4b1!4m6!3m5!1s0x47999113dbd676bd:0xaebda0363e565cfd!8m2!3d48.5258508!4d9.4156123!16s%2Fg%2F11p0w7p431?entry=ttu&amp;g_ep=EgoyMDI1MDEyNi4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><strong>Waldgeflüster Events</strong><br>Kaltentalstrasse 52 📍<br>72584 Hülben</a></p>
